 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "Repo ids look like owner/name. Commands that take path params need them split into --owner and --name, e.g. meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct becomes --owner meta-llama --name Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct. The datasets-server commands take the full id in --dataset.",
  "search-models and search-datasets use a 0-based page index p, with 30 items per page. numTotalItems in the raw response gives the total count.",
  "Filter values carry prefixes: license:apache-2.0, modality:text, format:json. num_parameters uses the form min:0,max:6B.",
  "Gated models (gated: 'manual'/'auto') return metadata publicly, but their file downloads need an authenticated account that has accepted the terms. get-model-file only works for public, non-gated files.",
  "semantic-search-spaces returned an empty array during exploration, so it may return no results.",
  "Dataset-viewer row search did not load during exploration and is not included. Use check-dataset-viewer and get-dataset-statistics instead.",
  "Writes such as Like and Follow need a logged-in session and were not captured."
